# School levels

Canonical page: **`wiki/School-Levels.md`**. Read it before writing or drawing
anything that depends on campus climate — event dialogue, `<school_level>`
stills, paperdoll `level=`, or character outfit cards.

The named stages (Pure and Innocent → Sexual Anarchy) describe the **student
body**. Teacher / parent / secretary have parallel numeric levels; students in
Class 3A follow **school**.

Do not invent a level's dress or tone from memory. If wiki and code disagree
(gates, who gets SET on a vote), trust the code and mention the drift.
